  "description": "dotnet global tool for Cobertura coverage reporting, diffing, and CI gating.\n\nInstallation:\n  dotnet tool install -g DotCov.Tool\n\nUsage:\n  dotcov report TestResults/\n  dotcov report coverage.cobertura.xml --format json\n  dotcov check TestResults/ --min-line 80 --exclude-generated\n  dotcov diff before.xml after.xml --format md\n  dotcov snapshot TestResults/ --commit SHA --branch main --project MyApp",
